id=malachite_performance
name=malachite performance: MediaTek governor, cache QoS and ADPF
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=noamtu123
description=Runs the CPU the way stock HyperOS does on this chip: MediaTek's sugov_ext frequency governor, L3 cache partitioning for the foreground app (cpuqos), and Android's per-frame CPU hints (ADPF) for apps and games. Use the Action button to switch the governor back to schedutil for comparison. Remove the module to restore the ROM's behaviour.
